cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "AI4S-OrgChem: An AI-for-Science Agent Replication of Destabilizing-Delocalization Claims (verification arm)"
message: "If you use this AI4S Agent replication package, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Chen"
    given-names: "Xiao"
    alias: "Xiao Chen"
    email: "chenxiao0101@gmail.com"
  - name: "AI4S-OrgChem verification arm"
    alias: "AI4S-OrgChem Agent"
abstract: >
  An AI-for-Science (AI4S) agent project using state-of-the-art LLM agent technology
  (AI4S Agent) with PySCF to independently verify nine propositions (P1–P9) from
  Professor Zhongheng Yu's Questioning Fundamental Principles of Organic Chemistry under pre-registered criteria and hard evidence gates. Result of this arm:
  8 agree, 1 dissent (P1). One of three planned independent LLM-agent verification arms.
  Does not redistribute the copyrighted book PDF or extracted full text.
keywords:
  - AI-for-science
  - AI4S
  - LLM-agent
  - reproducibility
  - quantum-chemistry
  - PySCF
  - organic-chemistry
  - conjugation
  - aromaticity
